webdav-client-cpp
------------------------------------------
C++ WebDAV Client provides easy and convenient to work with WebDAV-servers

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcurl4-8.23.0-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libpugixml1-1.9-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libwdc-devel-1.1.5-1bl2
  libwdc1-1.1.5-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libboost-devel-1.66.0-1
  libcurl-devel-8.23.0-1
  libpugixml-devel-1.9-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/CloudPolis/webdav-client-cpp

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/CloudPolis/webdav-client-cpp/archive/refs/tags/v1.1.5.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack webdav-client-cpp-1.1.5-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./webdav-client-cpp-1.1.5-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/webdav-client-cpp-1.1.5-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/webdav-client-cpp-1.1.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libwdc1-1.1.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libwdc-devel-1.1.5-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(webdav-client-cpp)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/webdav-client-cpp.README
  /usr/share/doc/webdav-client-cpp/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/webdav-client-cpp/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/webdav-client-cpp/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/webdav-client-cpp/README.md

(libwdc1)
  /usr/bin/cygwdc-1.dll

(libwdc-devel)
  /usr/include/webdav/client.hpp
  /usr/lib/cmake/WDC/WDCConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/WDC/WDCConfigVersion.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/WDC/WDCTargets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/WDC/WDCTargets.cmake
  /usr/lib/libwdc.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/webdav-client-cpp.pc

